ver/031.md\n317 | - 涉及文件：api/company/personnelRecord.js、company/staffManagement/components/detail.vue、institution/agencyPersonnel/components/AgencyPersonnelDetail.vue、components/OperationBtnGroup/index.vue、utils/flowApi.js、institution/leasePersonnel/components/LeasePersonnelDetail.vue、company/companyChangeManage/index.vue、components/ZsApproval/index.vue\n318 | - 所属项目：苏州市房地产监测V3；来源会话：6023b157-4f28-471e-8f2b-868c05df16b7；代码基线：none\n319 | \n320 | ===== 15 | viking://user/default/memories/entities/前端缺陷/vote_area_column.md | 17ea6763243537b2 =====\n321 | # Vote Area Column Center Fix\n322 | Fix for voting tables' building area column not centered, unified width 130 and center align across Huaian and Huishan projects.\n323 | \n324 | ## Root Cause\n325 | - `zs-table-column.vue` `amountFormatter` defaults to right align only when `align`/`headerAlign` not passed; explicit `center` works.\n326 | \n327 | ## Fix\n328 | - Six voting tables (e.g., `DecisionRangeTable`) set building area column `width:130`, `align:center`, `headerAlign:center`.\n329 | - Sync with Huishan project unified to same 130 width.\n330 | \n331 | ## Involved Files\n332 | - `zhi2-we\n\n[...]\n\ned pagination in view (pagInView true), no scroll; tester screenshot likely old cached bundle\n381 | \n382 | ## Resolution Action\n383 | - DBX write-back: status resolved, resolution fixed, resolvedBuild trunk, resolvedBy tiany, resolvedDate 2026-11-09 13:28:49, assignedTo lichandan\n384 | - Added zt_action id 89293 with 1226-char note; action history: opened -> assigned -> edited -> resolved -> activated -> resolved\n385 | - No source code changes; temp files .tmp-bug6084 deleted\n386 | \n387 | ===== 18 | viking://user/default/memories/entities/技术模式/bank_reconciliation_optimize.md | 5e3bff0afff15d4f =====\n388 | # 业务对账界面提示语布局优化\n389 | 产品2.0 项目优化业务对账界面提示语布局，回退其他无关修改。\n390 | \n391 | ## 保留的变更\n392 | - `BankReconciliation.vue` 中提示语由 `<p>` 改为带图标的 `<div class=\"tip-text\">` 结构\n393 | - 增加黄色背景、边框、圆角、flex 对齐等样式\n394 | - 提示文案内容未改动\n395 | \n396 | ## 已回退的内容\n397 | - 按钮文案（恢复为「手工核销」「批量删除」）\n398 | - 表格列配置、搜索条件顺序、整体布局结构\n399 | - `property/bankDetailDay/index.vue` 外层包裹及成功提示文案\n400 | \n401 | ## 验证与归属\n402 | - 验证证据：extracted source=cursor project=产品2.0\n403 | - 涉及文件：`BankReconciliation.vue`、`property/bankDetailDay/index.vue`、`property/bankDetailDay/components/ReconciliationBusinessTable.vue`、`benefit/pubBankDetailDay/index.vue`\n404 | - 所属项目：产品2.0；来源会话：f1a206e1-be4e-4eb5-a9b0-578ecda15418；代码基线：none\n405 | \n406 | ===== 19 | viking://user/default/memories/entities/技术模式/腾讯地图坐标安全校验.md | a4d4a3f6a2bfc47d =====\n407 | # 腾讯地图坐标安全校验\n408 | 产品2.0 统计地图页因多边形坐标串分隔符解析错误导致 NaN，所有 LatLng 构造必须走安全校验函数。\n409 | \n410 | ## 问题现象\n411 | - 统计地图页（benefit/statisticsMap）mounted 阶段抛腾讯地图异常「LatLng 传入参数 (NaN, 120.311972) 非合法数字」。\n412 | - 一条脏数据让整个地图初始化崩溃。\n413 | \n414 | ## 根因\n415 | - 后端返回园区多边形 path 字符串用「;」分隔各点、「,」分隔经纬度，解析函数却按空格 split(' ') 切分，首个点解析成 NaN。\n416 | - 构造 LatLng 前无合法性校验。\n417 | \n418 | ## 解决方案\n419 | - 解析函数统一按 ';' 切点、',' 切经纬度，对接字符串型几何数据必须先确认实际分隔符。\n420 | - 封装 createSafeLatLng(lat, lng)，内部 Number 转换 + isFinite 校验，非法值返回 null 并跳过该点。\n421 | - initMap、updateCenter、区域标注 nameLocation 等所有构造坐标入口都走安全构造。\n422 | \n423 | ## 验证与涉及\n424 | - 验证证据：会话结论根因是解析错分隔符，新增 createSafeLatLng 统一转数字校验，getBuildingPaths 从 split(' ') 改为按 ';' 切分，相关入口全改安全构造。\n425 | - 涉及文件：zhi2-web-admin/src/views/benefit/statisticsMap/components/map.vue；zhi2-web-admin/src/constant/map.js\n426 | - 所属项目：产品2.0\n427 | - 来源会话ID：4ba54bd2-24d5-4b33-92bc-49f3cc906331\n428 | - 代码基线：a53a27c\n429 | \n430 | ## 验证与归属\n431 | - 验证证据：extracted source=cursor project=产品2.0\n432 | \n433 | ===== 20 | viking://user/default/memories/entities/无锡市区小程序嵌入h5技术/face_backurl_base64.md | 9ecd415780d1c38d =====\n434 | # 第三方人脸跳转backUrl用Base64\n435 | 生产 H5 为 hash 路由时，将完整回跳地址作为外层 query 的 backUrl 须用 Base64 编码，不能仅用 encodeURIComponent。\n436 | \n437 | ## 问题根因\n438 | - 生产 H5 为 hash 路由（如 https://wygl.wxwgzx.com:8989/szh5/sfb/#/pages/webview/home?...）\n[Notice: 160 items displayed; complete=false; Trunca