{"id": "msg_bcdb341e7b804db3b6e7e5b7027e69a1", "role": "user", "parts": [{"type": "tool", "tool_id": "chatcmpl-tool-baf9403737900f4a", "tool_name": "ops_inspect_local_file", "tool_uri": "", "skill_uri": "", "tool_status": "completed", "tool_output": "[cwd: resolvedFrom=D:\\repository\\skills; cwdSource=workingDirectory.]\n=== FILE: C:\\Users\\Administrator\\.dsh\\cache\\memory-audit\\candidates.txt (Lines 439-608 of 935) ===\n[Notice: revision=d011a95a8f86d562a817ad361b591ffe9eddcebf54b6a518d3cfcb4500e67f55; bytes=64005.]\n439 | - 将完整回跳地址作为外层 query 的 backUrl 时，#、?、& 会使参数被截断或拆成多个 query 段\n440 | - encodeURIComponent 虽可转义，但对接方若按 Base64（atob）解析 backUrl，仅做 URI 编码会导致重定向失败\n441 | \n442 | ## 解决方案\n443 | - backUrlFull → Base64 → 作为单个 query 值传递（外层再做标准 query 转义）\n444 | - 联调前与第三方确认解码方式\n445 | \n446 | ## 验证与归属\n447 | - 验证证据：extracted source=cursor project=无锡市区小程序嵌入H5\n448 | - 涉及文件：zhi2-mobile-admin-h5-c-unlimited/src/utils/portal.js、src/pages/face/face.vue、src/pages/face/bdc.vue\n449 | - 所属项目：无锡市区小程序嵌入H5；来源会话：2adff739-19f3-452a-bfc9-ae1b4ad9efc9；代码基线：7de00b1\n450 | \n451 | ===== 21 | viking://user/default/memories/entities/technical_pattern/vote_waiver_bug.md | b1250d35e0cbb2f3 =====\n452 | # vote.js misreads waiver location causing empty abstention param\n453 | In 太仓一网通办H5, vote.js reads the waiver option from data.data.waiver (actually at top-level data.waiver), causing optionList to be empty.\n454 | \n455 | ## Root Cause\n456 | - vote.js fetchSelectView mistakenly read waiver from data.data.waiver after refactor\n457 | - Interface waiver option is actually at top-level data.waiver\n458 | - Caused optionList empty and missing abstention param\n459 | \n460 | ## Fix\n461 | - vote.js fetchSelectView uses detail.waiver || data.waiver to write voteWaiver\n462 | - OptionStepChoose.vue and election.ts sync the read logic\n463 | \n464 | ## Verification\n465 | - Evidence: extracted source=cursor session=a8c326c2-9bf5-46ac-a057-08be20ab8806\n466 | - Files: src/views/owner-decision/components/OptionStepChoose.vue, src/views/owner-decision/ParticipateIn.vue, src/views/owner-decision/components/GeneralStepChoose.vue, src/store/vote.js, src/views/election/ElectionParticipate.vue, src/store/election.ts, src/views/election/ElectionForm.vue, src/views/decision/components/StepChoose.vue\n467 | - Project: 太仓一网通办H5; source session: a8c326c2-9bf5-46ac-a057-08be20ab8806; code baseline: none\n468 | \n469 | ===== 22 | viking://user/default/memories/entities/技术模式/美股月度forwardpe沿用上月末约定.md | cc7981ebdd621538 =====\n470 | # 美股月度ForwardPE沿用上月末约定\n471 | 美股月度 Forward PE 在回测与实盘须沿用上月末已发布值，避免当月未来数据造成的未来函数嫌疑。\n472 | \n473 | ## 数据规则\n474 | - historyofmarket.com 等来源 Forward PE 为月度序列，当月完整值通常月底或下月初更新\n475 | - 月中跑回测或生成交易记录时，默认沿用上一月末已发布的 Forward PE，不使用当月点位\n476 | \n477 | ## 文档说明\n478 | - README/回测说明须写清该规则，避免如 8 月 4 日仍使用 8 月整月估值的误解\n479 | \n480 | ## 验证与归属\n481 | - 验证证据：会话 efd15316 质疑 2026-08-04 回测含 1–8 月记录与月度 Forward PE 发布时间矛盾\n482 | - 涉及文件：d:/repository/投资推送/README.md、us_index_data.py\n483 | - 所属项目：投资推送；来源会话ID：efd15316-7993-488b-8278-c5e62b92d106\n484 | \n485 | ===== 23 | viking://user/default/memories/entities/技术模式/form_error_slot_global.md | 3d1\n\n[...]\n\n-dialog 的 title 属性改为 header，以与 company 组件一致。\n563 | ## 背景\n564 | - depositNotice/components/PaymentRangeTable.vue 的新增选择弹窗原使用 title=\"初交明细选择\"。\n565 | - company/components/PaymentRangeTable.vue 使用 header 属性，需保持一致。\n566 | ## 修改\n567 | - 将 isProjectDialogVisible 与 isBuildDialogVisible 对应弹窗的 title= 改为 header=。\n568 | - 文件内既有 TS 报错非本次引入，仅做弹窗属性对齐。\n569 | ## 验证与归属\n570 | - 验证证据：extracted source=cursor project=2-0\n571 | - 涉及文件：src/views/maintenance/depositNotice/components/PaymentRangeTable.vue、company/components/PaymentRangeTable.vue。\n572 | - 所属项目：2-0；来源会话：64df7727-22c7-4f7d-ab8e-726440dc4ed9；代码基线：none\n573 | \n574 | ===== 28 | viking://user/default/memories/entities/技术模式/change_form_contract.md | 86454be0e76b0416 =====\n575 | # 变更详情双数据源契约：form只放变更单、beforeForm只放对比字段\n576 | 企业基本信息变更详情需展示「变更前/变更后」对比，页面同时请求 companyRecordChange/detail 与 companyRecord/detail，误将备案单整表合并进 form 污染 bizState。\n577 | \n578 | ## 错误原因\n579 | - 产品2.0 没有 displayStatus（那是 V3 口径），变更单状态唯一来源是 companyRecordChange/detail 返回的 bizState（例：在途=1）\n580 | - 任何把备案数据 merge 进 form 的写法都会污染判定，按钮组/编辑门控全部读 form.bizState，表现为状态对但按钮不对\n581 | \n582 | ## 契约规则\n583 | - form 只来自 companyRecordChange/detail\n584 | - beforeForm 只存对比业务字段，由 pickChangeBeforeForm 从 originInfo 或 companyRecord/detail 白名单挑（企业名称、地址、法人等），显式不含 bizState、approveState\n585 | - loadChangeBeforeForm 拉备案数据只写 beforeForm，查看态与编辑态都加载\n586 | - 新增（formMode=add）预填走 mergeChangeRecordIntoForm，同样排除 bizState、companyRecordChangeId\n587 | \n588 | ## 涉及文件与归属\n589 | - zhi2-web-admin/src/views/company/companyManagement/change/detail.vue\n590 | - zhi2-web-admin/src/views/company/companyManagement/components/detail.vue\n591 | - zhi2-web-admin/src/mixins/detailMixins.js\n592 | - 所属项目：产品2.0；来源会话 88acb085-eda3-448f-892d-0b062cf5f142；代码基线 62d5fb9\n593 | \n594 | ===== 29 | viking://user/default/memories/entities/苏住房c技术/tech_stack_warnings.md | e3c7c0dd6ec9374e =====\n595 | # 苏住房C 市民端技术栈与构建告警口径\n596 | 苏住房C 市民端 zhi2-mobile-shimin 是 Vue3 + Vite 的 uni-app 工程，index.html 全局脚本与 vite sourcemap 重复是两类高频噪声，需分清噪声与真错。\n597 | \n598 | ## 技术栈与结构\n599 | - 移动端工程 zhi2-mobile-shimin：uni-app，Vue3 + Vite，页面按 pages_owner / pages_owner_extra / pages_transaction / pages_my / pages_tab 业务域分包\n600 | - 静态资源按页面目录 static 就近放，如 pages_owner/repair/static/\n601 | - /static/js/utils 下国密/字节工具（如 byteUtil.js）走 pre-commit ESLint 门禁\n602 | \n603 | ## 构建噪声与真错\n604 | - index.html 里 /static/js/crypto-js.min.js、/static/js/sign.js 用 `<script defer>` 经典脚本加载，Vite 只 bundle ES module，提示「未被 module 化」属预期行为可忽略（sign.js 依赖全局 window.CryptoJS 必须用经典脚本），只需确认产物可访问\n605 | - vite.config.ts 的 build 里若条件编译写两个 sourcemap 键，esbuild 报 duplicate-object-key 且静默覆盖，是真正要修的配置错误\n606 | - sourcemap 收敛为一条：`sourcemap: process.env.UNI_PLATFORM === 'h5' ? mode !== 'production' : false`\n607 | \n608 | ## 提交门禁与修复\n[Notice: 170 items displayed; complete=false; TruncatedBy: worker-limit; nextOffset=609; omitted=327; matched=935; failed=0.]\n\n(Omitted 5408 bytes. Full formatted result stored at: C:\\Users\\ADMINI~1\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\dsh-spill-PrMk3N\\session-6bfd4348183e\\641d8c470824-ops_inspect_local_file.txt. Use read with offset/limit, or grep this path to search within it.)", "tool_output_group_id": "msg_bcdb341e7b804db3b6e7e5b7027e69a1", "tool_output_group_original_chars": 5932, "tool_output_group_budget_chars": 100000}], "created_at": "2026-11-26T14:35:11.899Z", "peer_id": "github.com-tyvt-skills"}
